<h2>Rich text</h2>

<p>
  Text goes beyond bold and italics: <s>strikethrough</s>, <kbd>Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>K</kbd>,
  <mark>highlighted</mark> text, <sub>sub</sub>script and <sup>super</sup>script.
</p>

<table>
  <tr><th>Key</th><th>Action</th><th>Where</th></tr>
  <tr><td><kbd>→</kbd></td><td>next step</td><td>everywhere</td></tr>
  <tr><td><kbd>o</kbd></td><td>overview</td><td>audience window</td></tr>
  <tr><td><kbd>p</kbd></td><td>presenter window</td><td>audience window</td></tr>
</table>

<ul>
  <li>☑ tables</li>
  <li>☑ lists</li>
  <li>☐ your idea here</li>
</ul>

<notes>
  Tables are a table with tr, th and td tags. The inline tags are b, i, c, s, a, kbd, mark, sub, sup and tex.
</notes>
